ferrosintesis-samples-honkytonk
===============================

The embedded WAV samples in this crate are derived from the FreePats "Honky-tonk
Piano" — a Francis Bacon player piano recorded by Piotr Barcz; the sound bank was
assembled by roberto@zenvoid.org for the FreePats project.

